WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.368 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This show sort of happene
for you --

00:00:01.368 --> 00:00:02.669 size:84% position:42%
I remember we first met
when you were doing...

00:00:02.669 --> 00:00:04.137
-Yeah, yes, yes.
-...I think an off-Broadway play

00:00:04.137 --> 00:00:06.673 align:start size:94% position:6%
right before this show started
-Yes, that's right.

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:09.676
-So you had this -- this sort of
maybe a little later

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:10.810 align:start size:94% position:6%
in your career
than you would expect

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:12.178 align:start size:94% position:6%
to have a show
that ran this long.

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:14.914 align:start size:94% position:6%
What was your
first entry into --

00:00:14.914 --> 00:00:16.316 size:88% position:44%
you know, the first time
you got an agent like?

00:00:16.316 --> 00:00:19.352 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, well, I had a rough -
I had a rough entry.

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:21.121 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, I -- when I --
It was here.

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:24.924
In fact, I think about it ever
time I go through Times Square

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:28.695 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because I had moved here,
you know,

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:30.964 align:start size:94% position:6%
like many people,
for a relationship.

00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:32.665 align:start size:94% position:6%
And now I found myself
in New York,

00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:33.767 align:start size:94% position:6%
and this woman
that I was dating,

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:37.037
kindly enough,
set up a meeting with her agent,

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:39.539 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it was a legitimate agent.
It was, like, a real agent

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:41.908
It wasn't like a
"Broadway Danny Rose" situation.

00:00:41.908 --> 00:00:42.876 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right.
-So I was nervous.

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:45.779 align:start size:94% position:6%
I put on, like, my cool clothe
which was, like,

00:00:45.779 --> 00:00:47.480 align:start size:94% position:6%
my black T-shirt
and black pants,

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.115 align:start size:94% position:6%
which has never been cool.
-No.

00:00:49.115 --> 00:00:49.849 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Ever.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.849 --> 00:00:51.618 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It is a good way to say,
"I'm an actor..."

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:53.686 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, totally!
-"...who right after this

00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:55.789 align:start size:94% position:6%
has to go be a waiter."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.789 --> 00:01:00.060 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm not saying -- I'm not
saying I was wearing Capezios,

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:01.394 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I'm also not saying
I wasn't.

00:01:01.394 --> 00:01:03.163 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right. Sure. You don't
want to commit either way.

00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:06.299 align:start size:94% position:6%
Right, yeah, yeah, yeah.
-But anyway so, I --

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:09.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
I ended up going up,
and meeting and sat down

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:13.139 align:start size:94% position:6%
with a gentleman at the agency
who looked at my résumé,

00:01:13.139 --> 00:01:16.076 align:start size:94% position:6%
which had like maybe two o
three regional theater credits

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:18.211 align:start size:94% position:6%
and, you know,
basically set it down

00:01:18.211 --> 00:01:20.947 align:start size:94% position:6%
and sort of
looking me up and down,

00:01:20.947 --> 00:01:24.117 align:start size:94% position:6%
and began telling me
all of the things

00:01:24.117 --> 00:01:26.453 align:start size:94% position:6%
that were wrong with me
physically.

00:01:26.453 --> 00:01:27.620 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow.
-He was like -- he was like,

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:32.425
"So, yeah. So your eyebrow
are too big for television."

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:33.093 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:36.963 align:start size:94% position:6%
"And your features are reall
too big for film."

00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:37.897 size:88% position:44% line:92%
And meanwhile, you know,

00:01:37.897 --> 00:01:39.432 size:78% position:39%
he's just confirming
my own self-loathing.

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:42.769
I'm like, "Yeah, uh-huh."
-You weren't -- right.

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:43.837 line:92%
You didn't go in going like,

00:01:43.837 --> 00:01:45.371 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Wait till he sees
these eyebrows."

00:01:45.371 --> 00:01:46.906 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:01:46.906 --> 00:01:48.441 line:92%
No. I was like, "Nailed it."

00:01:48.441 --> 00:01:50.110 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's like,
"You got a weird chin."

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:53.546 line:92%
I'm like, "Oh, it's a joke."

00:01:53.546 --> 00:01:56.683 size:78% position:39%
But, anyway, so he --
he basically says,

00:01:56.683 --> 00:01:59.452 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Well, you know,
maybe you could do theater

00:01:59.452 --> 00:02:02.555 align:start size:94% position:6%
Are you willing
to shave your arms?"

00:02:02.555 --> 00:02:05.558 align:start size:94% position:6%
Which I was like --
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:05.558 --> 00:02:08.995
And I was so desperate
to get an agent that I was like,

00:02:08.995 --> 00:02:11.131 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Absolutely."
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.131 --> 00:02:13.700 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like,
"I'm dying to shave my arms!

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:15.135 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
"Are you kidding?

00:02:15.135 --> 00:02:17.303 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm looking for an excuse
to shave my arms.

00:02:17.303 --> 00:02:20.240 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is great."
And he said, "Great.

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:23.209 align:start size:94% position:6%
Shave your arms
and get new head shots,

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:24.978 align:start size:94% position:6%
and come back, and we'll hav
another conversation."

00:02:24.978 --> 00:02:26.946 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then I kind of slinked out
of the office

00:02:26.946 --> 00:02:30.216 align:start size:94% position:6%
and went downstairs
into Times Square,

00:02:30.216 --> 00:02:34.354 size:75% position:38%
and I was, you know,
just kind of, like,

00:02:34.354 --> 00:02:35.355 line:92%
mortified and devastated.

00:02:35.355 --> 00:02:38.258 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was standing there,
and as I was standing there,

00:02:38.258 --> 00:02:41.861 align:start size:94% position:6%
I had a little accident
in my drawers.

00:02:41.861 --> 00:02:44.764 align:start size:94% position:6%
I -- I soiled myself.
-You did?

00:02:44.764 --> 00:02:45.665 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.665 --> 00:02:50.003 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I remember thinking --
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.003 --> 00:02:54.541 align:start size:94% position:6%
I remember thinking
really clearly, "Huh.

00:02:54.541 --> 00:02:56.476 size:84% position:42% line:92%
So this is the bottom."

00:02:56.476 --> 00:02:58.011 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:58.011 --> 00:02:59.646 align:start size:94% position:6%
"This is it."
-Yeah, that's the bottom.

00:02:59.646 --> 00:03:01.247 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"This is it."
[ Applause ]

00:03:01.247 --> 00:03:04.417 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean, they do say
if you're gonna soil yourself,

00:03:04.417 --> 00:03:05.718 align:start size:94% position:6%
Times Square
is as good of a place --

00:03:05.718 --> 00:03:06.619 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-It's amazing.

00:03:06.619 --> 00:03:08.755
-'Cause you're probably only
half a block from someone else

00:03:08.755 --> 00:03:10.456 align:start size:94% position:6%
who's like,
"I'm also there, buddy."

00:03:10.456 --> 00:03:12.892 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean, Elmo soiled himself
-Elmo probably, yeah.

00:03:12.892 --> 00:03:14.394 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Statue of Liberty
soiled himself.

00:03:14.394 --> 00:03:16.196 line:92%
-Soiled herself, yeah, exactly

00:03:16.196 --> 00:03:17.597 size:84% position:42% line:92%
You -- this is no joke.

00:03:17.597 --> 00:03:20.633 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is a terrifying thing
that happened to you.

00:03:20.633 --> 00:03:23.002
I guess it's probably about,
what, five, six years ago?

00:03:23.002 --> 00:03:24.204 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, yeah, yeah.
-There was an e-mail hack.

00:03:24.204 --> 00:03:25.238 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, yeah.
-And you were one of

00:03:25.238 --> 00:03:27.807 align:start size:94% position:6%
