who had your e-mail hacked

00:03:27.807 --> 00:03:31.144
-Yeah. Yeah, like seven or eight
years ago I got a call --

00:03:31.144 --> 00:03:34.247
There was this person who wa
hacking celebrity e-mails,

00:03:34.247 --> 00:03:39.085
