a call from an FBI detective

00:03:39.085 --> 00:03:42.488
saying, "You were one of
the people who was hacked.

00:03:42.488 --> 00:03:45.258 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it really freaked me out
It was kind of crazy.

00:03:45.258 --> 00:03:48.895
And he said -- you know, in this
phone call, I was like,

00:03:48.895 --> 00:03:52.632 align:start size:94% position:6%
"So, why? Like, why is this gu
hacking people's e-mails?"

00:03:52.632 --> 00:03:55.702
