00:03:55.702 --> 00:03:56.769 line:92%
He was selling information."

00:03:56.769 --> 00:03:57.837 align:start size:94% position:6%
He was selling it
to the tabloids.

00:03:57.837 --> 00:04:00.039 align:start size:94% position:6%
He was selling photographs
and e-mails."

00:04:00.039 --> 00:04:04.010 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like, "Wow.
