00:04:07.747 --> 00:04:08.881 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:08.881 --> 00:04:11.317 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Uh, nothing."
[ Laughter ]

00:04:11.317 --> 00:04:13.253 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like,
"What do you mean nothing?

00:04:13.253 --> 00:04:17.457 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he was like,
"He couldn't find any takers."

00:04:17.457 --> 00:04:19.259 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:19.259 --> 00:04:21.561 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"It wasn't
for a lack of effort."

00:04:21.561 --> 00:04:22.328 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No!
[ Laughter ]

00:04:22.328 --> 00:04:23.696 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like, "Wait.
He was actively

00:04:23.696 --> 00:04:26.799 align:start size:94% position:6%
