00:04:36.976 --> 00:04:41.481
And I went from feeling like a
victim to being super-defensive.

00:04:41.481 --> 00:04:42.382 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-I was like,

00:04:42.382 --> 00:04:46.352
"Uh, I think you need to go back
through those e-mails."

00:04:46.352 --> 00:04:47.553 align:start size:94% position:6%
