[ Laughter ]

00:04:47.553 --> 00:04:50.757 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Go back through May 2002.
-Oh, yeah!

00:04:50.757 --> 00:04:52.825 size:81% position:41%
-"There's some stuff!"
-"There's some stuff!

00:04:52.825 --> 00:04:55.061 align:start size:94% position:6%
Somebody missed
my chili recipe."

